ind $c\\cdot (b\\times a)$, if $b\\times c=⟨2,3,0⟩$ and $a=⟨1,-2,2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we compute the triple scalar product \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨1,-2,2⟩\\cdot ⟨2,3,0⟩ \\\\  & =1\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot 3+2\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =2-6+0 \\\\  & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (b\\times a)=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20062/selection/ma-v1/3a812008182d2a6261a437909452d7ed1bea824cff5db7cbbc5282fa4c864415"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "8c705504-2cea-5ddc-b08e-6a1bbb835cc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" :answer/id #uuid "576a5111-d4c2-5668-9925-b9538a10c1d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "c8f1f0d1-3db2-5d07-ae5b-b9c0bbc13997" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "50658792-0b67-53e7-9bdb-d6e1498799cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection/f00d8b7a5eeed0dcaa02b7f16c350647a90a461726a760f9ecdf0379dbf8fa63" :answer/id #uuid "f766aff7-43ec-5b06-92f4-8605b195de2e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9c0bec4-04ae-5d8c-abbb-183894124b71" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-20059/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-20059/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-20059/selection/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" "q-20059/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-20059/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" "q-20059/selection/f00d8b7a5eeed0dcaa02b7f16c350647a90a461726a760f9ecdf0379dbf8fa63"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-20059" :question/id #uuid "5391e15f-b363-59a8-afb1-a8c023a79cd5" :question/math-academy-id "q-20059" :question/problem "Find $c\\cdot (a\\times b)$, if $3a\\cdot (\\sqrt{2}b\\times 3c)=18\\sqrt{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a\\cdot (\\sqrt{2}b\\times 3c) & =18\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\cdot \\sqrt{2}\\cdot 3\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =18\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $c$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (c\\times b) & =-2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $c$ and $a$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (a\\times b) & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20059/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e0b4d33-7699-5068-90f1-663534cd662d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20059"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128353/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "a8ea9abd-6fa0-5d34-9fb9-9a7441effb4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128353/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "f10bf2bf-b0f6-5415-8eee-ab26967034a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128353/selection/34d6a